WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:19.320
<v Menelaus>True, wife — yet you tell only half. Hear the horse's tale from within: I crouched in that timber belly with the best of the Argives, and Odysseus held command of us all, when you came circling in the dark.

2
00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:28.130
<v Narrator><i>Helen circled the horse and imitated the voices of the warriors' wives.</i>

3
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:33.580
<v Narrator><i>The hidden Greeks nearly answered.</i>

4
00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:39.630
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus restrained them and silenced Anticlus.</i>

5
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:47.520
<v Narrator><i>Telemachus hears proof of his father's endurance and command under pressure.</i>
